            {
              "name": "split",
              "item": [
                {
                  "name": "stem_separator",
                  "item": [
                    {
                      "name": "Split a file into stems using the stem separator presets",
                      "id": "a9b0ca15-c46f-448c-a1eb-dcf114b16d1b",
                      "protocolProfileBehavior": {
                        "disableBodyPruning": true
                      },
                      "request": {
                        "auth": {
                          "type": "apikey",
                          "apikey": [
                            {
                              "key": "key",
                              "value": "X-License-Key",
                              "type": "string"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "value",
                              "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                              "type": "string"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "in",
                              "value": "header",
                              "type": "string"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                          {
                            "key": "Content-Type",
                            "value": "application/json"
                          },
                          {
                            "key": "Accept",
                            "value": "application/json"
                          }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                          "mode": "raw",
                          "raw": "{\n  \"source_id\": \"<string>\",\n  \"presets\": {\n    \"stem\": \"wind\",\n    \"splitter\": \"auto\",\n    \"dereverb_enabled\": false,\n    \"encoder_format\": \"aac\",\n    \"multivocal\": \"<string>\",\n    \"extraction_level\": \"deep_extraction\"\n  },\n  \"idempotency_key\": \"<string>\"\n}",
                          "options": {
                            "raw": {
                              "headerFamily": "json",
                              "language": "json"
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        "url": {
                          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/split/stem_separator/",
                          "host": [
                            "{{baseUrl}}"
                          ],
                          "path": [
                            "api",
                            "v1",
                            "split",
                            "stem_separator",
                            ""
                          ]
                        },
                        "description": "\n    Result of /check/ includes 2 tracks:\n    - stem:{\"type\":\"stem\", \"label\":\"<stem_name>\", \"url\":\"...\"}\n    - without stem:{\"type\":\"back\", \"label\":\"no_<stem_name>\", \"url\":\"...\"}\n\n    LEAD_BACK VOCALS:\n    For 'vocals' stem you can use parameter multivocal=\"lead_back\" and receive both lead and backing vocals as separate stems.\n    Result of /check/ includes 4 tracks. Backing vocals track is optional and could be suppressed if not found in the audio:\n    lead vocals:{\"type\":\"stem\", \"label\":\"vocals@0\", \"url\":\"...\"}\n    backing vocals:{\"type\":\"stem\", \"label\":\"vocals@1\", \"url\":\"...\"}\n    instrumental:{\"type\":\"back\", \"label\":\"no_vocals\", \"url\":\"...\"}\n    instrumental + backing vocals:{\"type\":\"back\", \"label\":\"mix_no_lead\", \"url\":\"...\"}\n    "
                      },
